<h2 id="story-h" style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.3vw,46px); line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-0.02em">Happy Paws Cat Rescue began with a simple mission: to give every cat a second chance at life.</h2>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; max-width:560px">It was founded by Katrina, who has wanted to help cats in need ever since she was a little girl, and it has grown from a small effort in Stockton into a team of dedicated volunteers. Whether it's a kitten in need of a warm place or an older cat looking for a forever home, we're here to help.</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.04em">Stockton · Birmingham · Banbury</p>
